cff-version: 1.2.0
title: frozen-ruler
message: >-
  If you use frozen-ruler, or the frozen-benchmark discipline it implements, please
  cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Adam
    family-names: McDowell
repository-code: 'https://github.com/adamcdowell/frozen-ruler'
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A retrieval evaluation harness for markdown knowledge bases — hybrid search
  (dense embeddings and BM25 fused by reciprocal rank fusion, with an optional
  cross-encoder rerank and a PageRank graph lane) where the evaluation discipline
  is the product: sha256-frozen benchmark sets, drift refusal, per-class scoring,
  and honest statistics for small n.
keywords:
  - retrieval evaluation
  - information retrieval
  - benchmark
  - reciprocal rank fusion
  - BM25
